<p>A payout for <%= @designer.display_name %> needs your attention.</p>

<% if @notification.kind == "payout_reconciliation_required" %>
  <p>
    <strong><%= format_base_units(@notification.payload["amount_base_units"].to_i, @notification.payload["asset"]) %></strong>
    has an unconfirmed transfer result. No one will retry it automatically — marketplace operations
    verifies the existing on-chain result first, so your share cannot be paid twice. Your buyer's
    purchase and delivered license are unaffected.
  </p>
<% else %>
  <p>
    <strong><%= format_base_units(@notification.payload["amount_base_units"].to_i, @notification.payload["asset"]) %></strong>
    could not be sent (<%= @notification.payload["error_code"] %>). The amount remains recorded as owed
    to you in the immutable ledger. Your buyer's purchase and delivered license are unaffected.
  </p>
<% end %>

<p><%= link_to "Review payouts", designer_payouts_url(anchor: "payout-attention") %></p>

<p>
  You can turn off payout-issue emails in <%= link_to "Notifications", designer_notifications_url %>.
  In-product notifications and security notices are always kept.
</p>
